  What Ian said.  I do agree that it's definitely used more often in
practice.  About the only time that I don't use it is when I"m either
trying for a special effect, such as writing a song or poem, or trying to
save on typing by removing a cu in a case like, i.e., "lo gerku mi viska"
as opposed to "lo gerku cu viska mi".
           --gejyspa



